== T1  Lemma 3.1 (01-table.tex:64-91): U_q は q 次の体か
  p=  7 q=3 ell=  37 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=3 field_found=True -> OK
  p= 13 q=3 ell=  37 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=3 field_found=True -> OK
  p=  5 q=3 ell=  37 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=3 field_found=True -> OK
  p= 11 q=5 ell= 181 aux=True  |H_q|=  36 dim U_q=5 field_found=True -> OK
  p=  7 q=5 ell=  61 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=5 field_found=True -> OK
  p= 19 q=3 ell=  37 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=3 field_found=True -> OK
  p=  3 q=5 ell=  61 aux=True  |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=5 field_found=True -> OK
  p=  7 q=3 ell=  73 aux=False |H_q|=  24 dim U_q=3 field_found=False -> OK  (非体の証拠: minpoly T**3 - 2*T が可約)
  p= 13 q=3 ell=1009 aux=False |H_q|= 336 dim U_q=3 field_found=False -> OK  (非体の証拠: minpoly T**3 + 4*T**2 - 4*T - 3 が可約)
  p= 11 q=5 ell=  61 aux=False |H_q|=  12 dim U_q=5 field_found=False -> OK  (非体の証拠: minpoly T**5 - 4*T**4 - 3*T**3 - 2*T**2 - 2*T - 1 が可約)
  T1: OK
